1917 - Execution of Dutch spy Mata Hari in Paris 1945 - Execution of Pierre Lavall, head of the Vichy government in France 1946 - Suicide of Herman Goering in Nuremberg Prison 1962 - Founding of Amnesty International in London 1984 - Nikita Khrushchev deposed while on holiday on the Black Sea coast 1987 - Britain's worst storms since records began
